          "protein": 0,
          "fat": 0,
          "carbs": 65,
          "servingSize": "20 fl oz fountain cup",
          "sodium": 55,
          "sugars": 64
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "articleHtml": "<main>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Blaze Pizza Calories Calculator\n    </span>\n</p>\n<div>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n      Meta Title:\n     </span>\n<span>\n      Blaze Pizza Calories Calculator: Nutrition &amp; Macros\n     </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n      Meta Description:\n     </span>\n<span>\n      Calculate Blaze Pizza calories and nutrition by crust, cheese, sauce, toppings, and slices. Compare 11-inch and large pizzas, sides, salads, and more.\n     </span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.raqpc6dt6jsc\">\n<span>\n     Blaze Pizza Calories Calculator\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     At Blaze Pizza, the calorie count starts with one important question:\n    </span>\n<span>\n     what exactly is on your pizza?\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Crust, sauce, cheese, meats, vegetables, finishing drizzles, and the number of slices you eat all affect the final nutrition.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Blaze Pizza Calories Calculator above\n    </span>\n<span>\n     to compare menu items, check calories and macros, and calculate the nutrition of the portion you actually eat.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.t0bzuxcqce72\">\n<span>\n     Start With the Slice, Not the Whole Pizza\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Blaze's standard\n    </span>\n<span>\n     11-inch pizzas are cut into 6 slices\n    </span>\n<span>\n     , while Large pizzas are 14 inches and typically cut into 8 slices.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     That distinction matters when reading nutrition information.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If a listed value represents\n    </span>\n<span>\n     1 of 6 slices\n    </span>\n<span>\n     , eating three slices means you have eaten half of the 11-inch pizza. If you eat the entire pizza, the per-slice nutrition needs to be multiplied by six.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Large-pizza values should be calculated using their own serving information rather than assuming they scale exactly like the smaller pizza.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Always check whether the nutrition number refers to:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     one slice, half a pizza, or the full pizza.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.achzqwez6zjh\">\n<span>\n     A Build Your Own Pizza Does Not Have One Calorie Count\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     There cannot be one accurate calorie number for every Blaze\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Build Your Own Pizza\n    </span>\n<span>\n     .\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Your final pizza is the sum of its individual parts:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Crust + sauce + cheese + toppings + finishing sauces\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A pizza with red sauce, mozzarella, grilled chicken, and vegetables will have a different nutrition profile from one built with multiple cheeses, pepperoni, meatballs, and an olive oil drizzle.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For a custom pizza, ingredient-level calculation is much more useful than assigning one generic calorie value to \u201cBuild Your Own.\u201d\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.9fcq7efs6my8\">\n<span>\n     Crust Sets the Starting Point\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Before adding toppings, choose the correct crust.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Blaze offers multiple crust options for its 11-inch pizzas, while its Large pizzas use Classic Dough.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Changing the crust can affect calories, carbohydrates, sodium, and the overall size of the finished pizza. This means the same toppings placed on two different crusts should not automatically produce the same nutrition total.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Start with the crust first, then build the rest of your pizza on top of it.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.qgmq4m745sc4\">\n<span>\n     Toppings Add Up Differently\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Not every topping changes pizza nutrition in the same way.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Vegetable toppings may add relatively few calories, while ingredients such as cheese, pepperoni, meatballs, chicken, bacon, olive oil, and finishing drizzles can have a larger impact.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A topping can also change nutrients beyond calories.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For example:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Meat toppings\n    </span>\n<span>\n     may increase protein, fat, and sodium.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Extra cheese\n    </span>\n<span>\n     can increase protein, fat, saturated fat, and sodium.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Vegetables\n    </span>\n<span>\n     may add smaller amounts of calories along with carbohydrates and fiber.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Finishing sauces and drizzles\n    </span>\n<span>\n     can add calories, sugar, fat, or sodium depending on the ingredient.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The most accurate approach is to calculate the pizza as it is actually built.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.mdrnprcn8ed\">\n<span>\n     Signature Pizza or Build Your Own?\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Blaze also offers Signature Pizzas such as\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Carnivore, Four Cheese, Herbivore, Meatball Pie, Blazed BBQ, and Spicy Pepperoni\n    </span>\n<span>\n     .\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For these pizzas, use the nutrition entry for the standard recipe when you order it as listed.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Once you make significant substitutions, however, the standard nutrition number becomes less representative of the pizza you receive.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     That is where ingredient-level calculation becomes more useful.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.la5qcnpdw5b5\">\n<span>\n     Take Two Changes the Portion\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Blaze's\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Take Two\n    </span>\n<span>\n     menu combines half of an 11-inch pizza with another item such as a salad or Cheesy Bread option.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Half of an 11-inch pizza represents three of its six slices.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     To understand the complete meal, calculate the pizza portion and then add the nutrition of the side you selected.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     This is more accurate than using the nutrition for an entire pizza or looking only at the side.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.kenlxikyn0lm\">\n<span>\n     Do Not Forget Cheesy Bread, Salads, and Desserts\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Pizza may be the main reason for visiting Blaze, but the current menu also includes\n    </span>\n<span>\n     salads, Cheesy Bread, Pesto Garlic Cheesy Bread, desserts, drinks, and dressings\n    </span>\n<span>\n     .\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If your order includes more than pizza, add those items separately.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For example:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     3 pizza slices + side salad\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Pizza + Cheesy Bread\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Pizza + dessert + drink\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     can produce very different totals even when the pizza itself stays unchanged.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.crjc28vuvmj\">\n<span>\n     Blaze Pizza Nutrition Questions\n    </span>\n</h2><div class=\"faq-accordion-container space-y-3 my-6\"><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>How many calories are in a Blaze Pizza?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>How many slices are in an 11-inch Blaze Pizza?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>How many slices are in a Large Blaze Pizza?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Can I calculate a Build Your Own Blaze Pizza?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Does changing the crust change Blaze Pizza calories?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Are Blaze Pizza toppings included in the crust calories?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details></div>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.o85j45fonw18\">\n<span>\n     About the Blaze Pizza Nutrition Data\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     NutritionSolver organizes available\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Blaze Pizza nutrition information\n    </span>\n<span>\n     by pizza size, menu item, and other categories so you can compare individual products and calculate the nutrition of your actual order.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Blaze also maintains an official Nutrition Calculator. Recipes, toppings, menu items, and availability can change, so the database should be checked against Blaze's latest published nutrition information when updates occur.\n    </span>\n</p>\n</main>",
  "seoTitle": "Blaze Pizza Calories Calculator: Nutrition & Macros",
  "seoDescription": "Calculate Blaze Pizza calories and nutrition by crust, cheese, sauce, toppings, and slices. Compare 11-inch and large pizzas, sides, salads, and more.",
